title: Review is by fresh subagents, not by a colleague or the code's owner.
pid: ce953266-0423-4c68-87c1-d92981f6faed
body: |2-
  At Google and Microsoft a person reviews, often the code's owner.
  Here that is a mission per change; the owner's knowledge reaches the
  reviewer through its map, and the owner reads the commits later, for
  awareness, which Bacchelli and Bird found is much of what review gives.
